{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Preparing the Proposal"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Deserved Break"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Conversations are far more interesting when people interact during the conversation. It is important to ask for others' opinions on a subject as well as giving your own.<br/><br/>Here are some ways you can ask for and give opinions. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Opinions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Opinions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">Always ask questions that encourage a response: </span><ul><li>What do you think about ... ?</li> <li>What's your position on ... ?</li> <li>Where do you stand on ... ? </li> <li>What do you think of ... ?</li> <li>How do you feel (about ... )? </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">When you give opinions, make your opinions less forceful by using neutral statements:</span><ul><li>I'm happy that ... (+clause)</li> <li>I understand that ... (+clause)</li> <li>For peace of mind, ... (+clause)</li> <li>I believe ... (+clause)</li> <li>I think ... (+clause)</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">For peace of mind</span>, I will notify when I can't come in."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">I believe</span> people are worried about the working conditions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">I think</span> the proposal was satisfying. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing Feelings and Things"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Adjectives</span> are words used before nouns. They give information about the nouns and indicate qualities. They can also be used to describe your feelings and or things like the weather. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li><span class=\"italic\">\u201c-ing\u201d</span> adjectives are used to describe opinions, feelings, and things. <br/>Examples: <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">The whole experience was <span class=\"underline\">terrifying</span>.</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">The storm was a <span class=\"underline\">frightening</span> experience.</span></li></ul><br/><li><span class=\"italic\">\u201c-ed\u201d</span> adjectives are used to describe how people feel.<br/>Examples: <br/><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I was <span class=\"underline\">terrified</span> when the power went out. </li><li>I was <span class=\"underline\">frightened</span> by all the loud noises. </li><ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here's a table to help you understand \u201c-ed\u201d and \u201c-ing\u201d adjectives. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"feel \u201c-ed\u201d adjectives\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"describe \u201c-ing\u201d adjectives\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pleased\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pleasing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worrying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"exhausted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"exhausting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"satisfied\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"satisfying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"scared\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"scary\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "damaging"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing physical harm to someone or something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The storm wasn't too damaging. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when describing your feelings or reactions to the weather."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "terrifying"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing extreme fear"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The storm last night was terrifying."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "frightening"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "feeling afraid "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think the whole situation was a bit frightening. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "disturbing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "worrying; upsetting "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The weather situation was disturbing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reassuring"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "making you feel less worried or frightened"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was reassuring to know there wasn't much damage. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le04ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of weather conditions (for example: thunderstorms, high winds, snowstorms, etc.)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 2 to 3 sentences describing how you feel about them. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make sure you use adjectives ending with -ed and -ing. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your opinions with your partner. Discuss each opinion together."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you are finished, switch roles. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of topics about my workplace."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express how I feel about these while using adjectives ending with -ed and -ing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express my opinion using different phrases."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my opinions with a partner. "}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask for and respond to favors."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about my feelings and reactions to the weather."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can give opinions."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "When was the last time you asked for time off at work?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Why did you ask for time off? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Let's ask for some time off!"}]}, {"template