ossibly do me a favor?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>:  Just a minute. Peter. Could I ask you to notify us the next time you are unable to come into work? We were worried about you.", "id": 1}, {"time": "24000", "image": "engenn7le04ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No problem. The storm last night was terrifying. There were fallen trees everywhere in my neighbourhood.  I was lucky not to have been crushed by one. I believe you must have been worried about your employees. I thought it would be understood why I wasn't in the next day.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Did you have a close call?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think the whole weather situation was disturbing and frightening.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Personally, I'm glad to hear you're okay. You had us worried.", "id": 2}, {"time": "47000", "image": "engenn7le04ob09re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How did you manage to get home under the conditions?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: It was reassuring to know that the storm wasn't too damaging. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's amazing ... Janet, I feel exhausted after this experience. I would like to request a week off. To my mind, I'm sure I will be more productive. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Of course, you deserve it. I know you've been wanting some time off. I reckon things are calmer now. Could you please call the office if anything unexpected comes up? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sure. Thank you Janet.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}